{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f00bbede4211b0bc","name":"K-Wing Assault Starfighter","source":{"id":"source:reference-f00bbede4211b0bc","title":"K-Wing Assault Starfighter","revision":18731,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:38:24Z","sha256":"7d128608e7a9679367c352adc4877f9abedb00228896a6f03a26786552dd8c8c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18731","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=K-Wing%20Assault%20Starfighter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f00bbede4211b0bc","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Koensayr Manufacturing BTL-S8 K-Wing is an Assault Starfighter introduced as part of the the New Republic Defense Fleet. These ships are designed to serve as bombers and heaver ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},", roles previously filled by increasingly aged ",{"tag":"a","children":["Y-Wings"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Y-Wings"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The K-Wings serve well during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Black Fleet Crisis"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Black_Fleet_Crisis?action=edit&redlink=1"},", though their crew complement of four eventually causes them to become less popular as ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"}," continues to have major crises (making it difficult to train enough bombardiers and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," for the whole K-Wing fleet). Though still in use for decades after their deployment, they are much less common after the Yuuzhan Vong Invasion.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The prototypes and first production wave have no built-in weaponry; they carry whatever armament is appropriate to an individual mission. A typical load is given in the statistics block. Any normal missile or mine payload (or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_System"}," designed for a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},", with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Emplacement Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emplacement_Point"}," cost no higher than 0), can replace any of the given missile payload choices with a DC 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check and 5 minutes of work. K-Wings have no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"},", and thus must be carried to striking distance of each battle. They do have a ",{"tag":"a","children":["SLAM System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/SLAM_System?action=edit&redlink=1"},", allowing them to move quickly into attack positions once they are deployed. In case of emergency, the cockpit of a K-Wing can detach and act as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Escape Pod"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Escape_Pod","referenceId":"reference:a257ab4a352c2042"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A second generation of K-Wing designs added two turrets and reconfigured the cockpit to increase the bombadier's field of vision. The Quad ",{"tag":"a","children":["Laser Cannon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Laser_Cannon","referenceId":"reference:0911ab4bc0e93386"}," in the forward turret was augmented to be a multistage laser and thus is often called a Turbolaser, although it remains a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," class weapon, not a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"}," Turbolaser.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["K-Wing Assault Starfighter Statistics (CL 12)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +6; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 18 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 13), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 28; +8 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 160; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 10; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},": 30; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damag